, 157.55897521972656, 448.77435302734375, 192.14910888671875]}, {"text": "Total", "bbox": [467.718994140625, 172.47450256347656, 492.6969909667969, 186.04173278808594]}, {"text": "Points", "bbox": [109.30099487304688, 188.41549682617188, 140.5842742919922, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "50", "bbox": [167.50399780273438, 188.41549682617188, 178.8990020751953, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [208.72799682617188, 188.41549682617188, 214.4243927001953, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "4", "bbox": [247.10400390625, 188.41549682617188, 252.80039978027344, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "1", "bbox": [285.47998046875, 188.41549682617188, 291.1763610839844, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "5", "bbox": [323.85699462890625, 188.41549682617188, 329.5533752441406, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "9", "bbox": [362.2330017089844, 188.41549682617188, 367.92938232421875, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "35", "bbox": [397.760986328125, 188.41549682617188, 409.1559753417969, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "2", "bbox": [438.9849853515625, 188.41549682617188, 444.6813659667969, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "108", "bbox": [471.6650085449219, 188.41549682617188, 488.75860595703125, 201.98272705078125]}, {"text": "Atlas is a smooth single-faced fabric woven from natural silk. Atlas is not just a simple", "bbox": [108.24200439453125, 400.3005065917969, 487.0400695800781, 413.86773681640625]}, {"text": "fabric—it is a woven chronicle of the unique Uzbek culture and identity.", "bbox": [140.22000122070312, 412.2554931640625, 455.0566711425781, 425.8227233886719]}, {"text": "Enzyme mixtures are used for qualitative and quantitative analysis of organic substances in biological", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 445.6875, 538.572265625, 459.2547302246094]}, {"text": "fluids (plasma, urine, etc.). E1−E5 can contain one or several enzymes. These also contain all the neces-", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 457.64349365234375, 538.5778198242188, 471.2107238769531]}, {"text": "sary reagents (buffer and other components). E1−E5 are designed for the selective determination of i)", "bbox": [56.69300842285156, 469.5984802246094, 538.5848388671875, 483.16571044921875]}, {"text": "glucose, ii) urea, iii) uric acid, iv) cholesteryl ester, and v) triglyceride.", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 481.553466796875, 360.12799072265625, 495.1206970214844]}, {"text": "All reaction mixtures in this problem are prepared in a 96-well plate using a micropipette.", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 623.5244750976562, 473.2298889160156, 637.0916748046875]}, {"text": "The instructions below apply when performing the reaction between any substrate solution with any", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 641.4564819335938, 538.561767578125, 655.023681640625]}, {"text": "enzyme mixture E1−E5:", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 653.4124755859375, 165.80564880371094, 666.9796752929688]}, {"text": "1. For all reaction tests except those with E2, add 20 μL of the substrate solution to 100 μL of the", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 646.526123046875, 538.5787353515625, 712.478515625]}, {"text": "enzyme solution and incubate for approximately 5 min at room temperature.", "bbox": [81.60003662109375, 683.3004760742188, 443.8004150390625, 696.86767578125]}, {"text": "2. For mixture E2 (composed of separate solutions E2a and E2b), add 20 μL of substrate solution to", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 676.4141235351562, 538.5741577148438, 742.3665161132812]}, {"text": "100 μL of E2a solution. Incubate for approximately 5 min at room temperature. Add 100 μL of the", "bbox": [81.5999755859375, 688.369140625, 538.5769653320312, 754.322509765625]}, {"text": "E2b solution to this mixture and continue to incubate for approximately another 5 min at room", "bbox": [81.60000610351562, 725.1434936523438, 538.5894165039062, 738.710693359375]}, {"text": "temperature.", "bbox": [81.60000610351562, 737.0985107421875, 143.54811096191406, 750.6657104492188]}, {"text": "3. If the tested solution contains the specific substrate, the mixture shows a colour distinct from the", "bbox": [68.2509994506836, 755.031494140625, 538.5740966796875, 768.5986938476562]}, {"text": "other solutions without the specific substrate.", "bbox": [81.5999984741211, 766.9865112304688, 295.5873107910156, 780.5537109375]}]}, {"page": 4, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Experiment", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 138.68612670898438, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-4", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "Part A", "bbox": [56.29199981689453, 154.15460205078125, 89.92422485351562, 169.07861328125]}, {"text": "You are given the following substances in the 10 solutions S1−S10. Each solution S1−S10 contains only", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 173.15249633789062, 538.57958984375, 186.7197265625]}, {"text": "two substances out of the five substances i−v. S1−S10 contain different combinations of substances i−v.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 185.10751342773438, 538.5826416015625, 198.67474365234375]}, {"text": "The composition of S1−S5 is:", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 197.0625, 190.29510498046875, 210.62973022460938]}, {"text": "• S1: i + ii", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 214.99549865722656, 117.48383331298828, 228.56272888183594]}, {"text": "• S2: i + iv", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 232.92849731445312, 119.35519409179688, 246.4957275390625]}, {"text": "• S3: ii + iii", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 250.86050415039062, 122.41386413574219, 264.427734375]}, {"text": "• S4: iii + v", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 268.79351806640625, 121.92555236816406, 282.3607482910156]}, {"text": "• S5: iv + v", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 286.72650146484375, 121.4373779296875, 300.2937316894531]}, {"text": "Perform the tests of each solution S1−S10 with each enzyme mixture E1−E5. The tubes in your rack might", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 304.65948486328125, 538.5642700195312, 318.2267150878906]}, {"text": "not necessarily be arranged in numerical order. Some substrates could appear as cloudy solutions or", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 316.614501953125, 538.5650024414062, 330.1817321777344]}, {"text": "suspensions.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 328.5694885253906, 117.26629638671875, 342.13671875]}, {"text": "Q2.1", "bbox": [78.60802459716797, 351.53448486328125, 100.77259063720703, 365.1017150878906]}, {"text": "Tick the box with the corresponding colour change for each of the enzyme mix-", "bbox": [114.69256591796875, 351.53448486328125, 480.5586242675781, 365.10174560546875]}, {"text": "tures E1−E5 with substrates S1−S10, relative to the initial colour of E1, E2a, E3,", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 363.489501953125, 480.5846252441406, 377.0577392578125]}, {"text": "E4, and E5. The colour codes are given below:", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 375.44549560546875, 327.8586730957031, 389.0127258300781]}, {"text": "N - no colour change", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 387.4004821777344, 212.64109802246094, 400.96771240234375]}, {"text": "Y - change to yellow", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 399.35546875, 208.12962341308594, 412.9226989746094]}, {"text": "G - change to green", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 411.3104553222656, 207.06468200683594, 424.877685546875]}, {"text": "B - change to black", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 423.26544189453125, 203.38670349121094, 436.8326721191406]}, {"text": "PR - change to pink/red", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 435.2204284667969, 224.7889404296875, 448.7886657714844]}, {"text": "50 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 351.45941162109375, 519.1494750976562, 365.0266418457031]}, {"text": "Q2.2", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 469.9444885253906, 100.77256774902344, 483.51171875]}, {"text": "Tick the box for the enzyme−substrate pair(s) that gave a positive result.", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 469.9444885253906, 453.1542053222656, 483.51171875]}, {"text