2, 244.8834991455078, 140.06475830078125, 258.4507141113281]}, {"text": "• Cholesterol oxidase – CHO", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 262.8164978027344, 203.29554748535156, 276.38372802734375]}, {"text": "• Peroxidase – POD", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 280.7485046386719, 162.7738037109375, 294.31573486328125]}, {"text": "• Glycerol-3-phosphate oxidase – GPO", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 298.6815185546875, 250.00936889648438, 312.2487487792969]}, {"text": "• Glycerol kinase – GLK", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 316.614501953125, 179.40386962890625, 330.1817321777344]}, {"text": "• Non-enzymatic reaction – NEZ", "bbox": [72.87200164794922, 334.5475158691406, 220.50511169433594, 348.11474609375]}, {"text": "Q2.4", "bbox": [78.6080093383789, 357.51251220703125, 100.77257537841797, 371.0797424316406]}, {"text": "Intensely coloured products are formed only in two reactions from the list", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 357.51251220703125, 480.575927734375, 371.0797424316406]}, {"text": "above.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 369.4674987792969, 145.69528198242188, 383.03472900390625]}, {"text": "Tick the boxes for the reactions that give coloured products.", "bbox": [114.69100952148438, 381.4224853515625, 397.08477783203125, 394.98974609375]}, {"text": "1 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 357.3805236816406, 513.4508666992188, 370.94775390625]}, {"text": "Q2.5", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 417.08349609375, 100.77256774902344, 430.6507263183594]}, {"text": "Tick the components that are present in reaction mixtures E1−E5.", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 417.08349609375, 421.4416198730469, 430.6507263183594]}, {"text": "5 pt", "bbox": [495.45001220703125, 416.9524841308594, 513.4508666992188, 430.51971435546875]}, {"text": "Part B", "bbox": [56.29199981689453, 455.2055969238281, 89.72624206542969, 470.1296081542969]}, {"text": "Enzymes E2, E4, and E5 give positive tests with substrates F, G, and H, respectively. Solutions M1, M2,", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 474.2025146484375, 538.5825805664062, 487.7697448730469]}, {"text": "and M3 contain all of the substrates F, G, and H in different concentrations. For solutions M1−M3, after", "bbox": [56.69293212890625, 486.15850830078125, 538.5770263671875, 499.7257385253906]}, {"text": "approximately 5 min of enzymatic reaction, the colour intensity of the reaction mixture is linearly depen-", "bbox": [56.692901611328125, 498.1134948730469, 538.5916137695312, 511.68072509765625]}, {"text": "dent on the initial concentration of the substrate. Assume that approximately 5 min is enough to achieve", "bbox": [56.692901611328125, 510.0684814453125, 538.5834350585938, 523.6356811523438]}, {"text": "complete substrate conversion.", "bbox": [56.692901611328125, 522.0234985351562, 203.7216339111328, 535.5906982421875]}, {"text": "Perform the tests of each solution M1−M3 with each enzyme mixture E2, E4, and E5. Some substrates", "bbox": [56.692901611328125, 539.9564819335938, 538.5909423828125, 553.523681640625]}, {"text": "could appear as cloudy solutions or suspensions.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 551.9114990234375, 285.5146789550781, 565.4786987304688]}, {"text": "Q2.6", "bbox": [78.60802459716797, 574.8765258789062, 100.77259063720703, 588.4437255859375]}, {"text": "Arrange M1−M3 in increasing order of concentrations for each of F, G, and H", "bbox": [114.69256591796875, 574.8765258789062, 480.584716796875, 588.4437255859375]}, {"text": "substrates based on the performed reactions.", "bbox": [114.69097900390625, 589.176513671875, 328.73809814453125, 602.7437133789062]}, {"text": "9 pt", "bbox": [495.4499816894531, 574.7965087890625, 513.4508056640625, 588.3637084960938]}]}, {"page": 7, "width": 595.280029296875, "height": 841.8900146484375, "mode": "native", "lines": [{"text": "Experiment", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 63.1240119934082, 138.68612670898438, 82.42530822753906]}, {"text": "Q2-7", "bbox": [410.3869934082031, 59.77293014526367, 538.61376953125, 136.97825622558594]}, {"text": "English (Official)", "bbox": [460.8269958496094, 128.718505859375, 535.9927978515625, 142.28573608398438]}, {"text": "Part C", "bbox": [56.29199981689453, 154.15460205078125, 89.3463134765625, 169.07861328125]}, {"text": "Some or all of the substances W1−W7 can react with components of mixtures E1−E5 and interfere with", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 173.15249633789062, 538.5760498046875, 186.7197265625]}, {"text": "the accurate determination of their native substrates. Substances W1−W7 are given below:", "bbox": [56.6929931640625, 185.10751342773438, 481.28173828125, 198.67474365234375]}, {"text": "Perform the tests of each substance W1−W7 with each enzyme mixture E1−E5. Some substrates could", "bbox": [56.69300079345703, 325.36248779296875, 538.5817260742188, 338.9297180175781]}, {"text": "appear as cloudy solutions or suspensions.", "bbox": [56.693023681640625, 337.3174743652344, 257.2607421875, 350.88470458984375]}, {"text": "Q2.7", "bbox": [78.60802459716797, 360.282470703125, 100.77259063720703, 373.8497009277344]}, {"text": "Tick the box with the corresponding colour change for each of the enzyme mix-", "bbox": [114.69256591796875, 360.282470703125, 480.5586242675781, 373.8497314453125]}, {"text": "tures E1−E5 with substances W1−W7. Use the same colour codes as in Q2.1.", "bbox": [114.69100189208984, 372.23748779296875, 480.58465576171875, 385.8047180175781]}, {"text": "Compare the colour of the reaction mixtures to the initial colour of E1, E2a, E3,", "bbox": [114.6910400390625, 384.1934814453125, 480.5846862792969, 397.7607116699219]}, {"text": "E4, and E5.", "bbox": [114.69107055664062, 396.1484680175781, 165.63771057128906, 409.7156982421875]}, {"text": "35 pt", "bbox": [495.4500732421875, 360.20245361328125, 519.1495361328125, 373.7696838378906]}, {"text": "Q2.8", "bbox": [78.60800170898438, 440.3795166015625, 100.77256774902344, 453.9467468261719]}, {"text": "Write down the balanced reaction equation(s) that describe(s) the positive", "bbox": [114.69253540039062, 440.37951660